2) Classes: The existing classes `Exhibit`, `Painting`, and `Sculpture` have been modified, and three new classes `Photography`, `Artifact`, and `Fossil` have been added.

3) Encapsulation: Member variables are accessed through public getter methods and are modified through constructors.

